abstract: >
  Analysis code that applies literature-locked beta-cell identity and stress/UPR
  gene-set scores to public human islet transcriptomes (GSE50244, GSE76894,
  GSE38642, GSE20966), with GTEx v8 and Open Targets overlays. Stress-up is a
  prespecified arm that is not supported in the primary tests.
keywords:
  - type 2 diabetes
  - human islets
  - beta-cell identity
  - unfolded protein response
  - GEO
